### Register and copy accessToken from the response
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "intern@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Java Intern"
}

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Security",
  "description": "Complete the JWT authentication flow",
  "dueDate": "2030-12-31"
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=TODO&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
